00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:33.690
CHAPTER 67

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:38.610
THE SOCIAL MEDIA ADDICT VERSUS
THE JOMON MAN

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:45.770
Dad, it's a lovely morning, isn't it?

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:48.330
It's nice and sunny.

00:02:50.670 --> 00:02:52.730
What is it, Catchick?

00:02:52.730 --> 00:02:55.110
I got a RAIN message from Mana.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:58.670
<i>Cat-san! Did you see Chris' post?!</i>

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:00.620
Chris?

00:03:00.620 --> 00:03:02.910
She's an AmMo who's half Japanese.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:04.160
"AmMo"?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.160
It's short for "Amateur Model."

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:10.670
High school girls and business women
who model for magazines.

00:03:10.670 --> 00:03:12.120
This is Chris.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:17.320
#GREAT POOL!

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:17.380
Christine Minato. A half-Japanese college
girl who studied abroad in America.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:22.510
She's an influencer with over a million
followers on FACEBACK and INSTE.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.140
She's rather pretty.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:29.650
She's really popular
among the girls at Mana's school.

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:32.140
Why is she so popular?

00:03:32.140 --> 00:03:36.650
She goes to expensive restaurants
and parties in high-rise apartments,

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:41.930
#AWESOME PARTY!

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:41.990
and uploads nice photos,
so the girls idolize her.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:43.930
Really?

00:03:44.850 --> 00:03:46.870
But I don't really like her.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:52.230
It feels like she's doing it all
just to get Likes.

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:53.810
17,000 LIKES

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:59.420
With all the Likes and follower comments
and high share rates,

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:03.110
it just feels like she's
showing off saying, "Look at me!"

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:06.660
Hey, are you even listening?

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.120
Huh?

00:04:11.370 --> 00:04:14.670
My profit antenna just went "BiBiBi!"

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:21.240
I upload an unidentified creature
to social media.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:26.240
Then get lots of Likes and make a killing
with the ad revenue.

00:04:26.260 --> 00:04:31.140
UNIDENTIFIED CREATURE SIGHTINGS
MYSTERIOUS MONKEY MAN IN MT. HIBIRIDAKE!!

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:31.250
A genius plan if I do say so myself!

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.690
Could it be...?

00:04:36.270 --> 00:04:38.770
Th-This is...!

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.690
Roasted sweet potatoes?

00:04:47.740 --> 00:04:49.280
This is delicious!

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.440
He really exists!

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.820
<i>Hipili kapoli.</i>

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.760
Huh? What?

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.830
<i>Hakalapili.</i>

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:13.250
<i>Potoko topoto.</i>

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:15.480
Huh? You mean eat this?

00:05:18.020 --> 00:05:19.340
This is delicious!

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:21.980
I know! I'll use him!

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:24.420
Say, "cheese!"

00:05:25.450 --> 00:05:26.660
Saychee?

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:35.580
Let's see how many hundreds of Likes
I'll get on INSTE today.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:38.100
What is this?

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:41.280
Number five in followers is...

00:05:41.280 --> 00:05:42.880
Jomon Man?

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:47.680
A real Jomon era man?

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:51.220
With 20,000 Likes on INSTE?!

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.710
<i>He's just a flash fad.</i>

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:01.750
<i>A new, no, primitive man like this
will disappear in no time.</i>

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:04.480
Selfie time, selfie time.

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:10.780
ELECTRIFYING EXPLOSION OF LOVE

00:06:08.200 --> 00:06:12.020
<i>The Batteries' new single is on sale now!
It's electrifying!</i>

00:06:12.020 --> 00:06:13.180
Let's see...

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:19.020
So to gain Likes, I should just imitate
stuff from someone with lots of Likes.

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:24.240
<i>I see. "Look at how cute I am!
Look at me more!"</i>

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:24.170
#LUNCH WITH FRIENDS

00:06:24.240 --> 00:06:26.590
<i>I just post stuff like this.</i>

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.910
<i>Affordable! Giga Deluxe Steak!
Only 19,800 yen for a limited time!</i>

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.200
<i>Talk about affordable!</i>

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:36.390
Like hell!
Who can eat something so expensive?!

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:39.690
Giga Deluxe Steak!

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:42.320
Listen, Jomon era man.

00:06:42.320 --> 00:06:46.470
To want yet endure is the way of
modern civilization.

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:47.740
Get it?

00:06:48.240 --> 00:06:49.430
<i>Kamoi</i>!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:51.930
"<i>Kamoi</i>"? What's that?

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.390
<i>Kamoi</i>!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.830
Oh well.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.620
And... Post!

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:03.650
Ooh, 20,000 Likes already! Impressive!

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:06.700
Oh! Is that Jomon Man?

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:07.820
What's that?

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:11.780
Dude, I know him! He's number five
in followers on INSTE, right?

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:14.160
Wow! A celebrity!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:17.350
Hey, no photos without permission.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:20.670
<i>Kamoi</i>!

00:07:20.670 --> 00:07:22.620
Dude, what's "<i>Kamoi</i>"?

00:07:22.620 --> 00:07:25.960
Who knows?
Maybe it means "Like" in Jomon language.

00:07:25.960 --> 00:07:27.220
Hilarious, Dude.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:28.720
<i>Kamoi</i>!<i> Kamoi</i>!

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:29.760
<i>Kamoi</i>!

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:30.880
<i>Kamoi</i>!!

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.640
Oh well. Make sure to spread that around.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.100
<i>Kamoi</i>!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:41.080
<i>Kamoi</i>!!

00:07:41.670 --> 00:07:43.650
FANCY RESTAURANT

00:07:45.960 --> 00:07:48.030
An organic lunch!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:51.150
I see you got more Likes, Chris.

00:07:51.150 --> 00:07:53.410
25,000 Likes.

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.040
They're saying,
"Looks delicious! Super healthy!"

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:57.910
Obviously!

00:07:57.910 --> 00:08:01.890
A modern human couldn't lose to
a Jomon era man.

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:06.670
<i>An organic lunch!</i>

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:08.420
30,000 Likes?!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.920
Whoops. You lost.

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:12.470
They're saying,
"Looks delicious! Super healthy!"

00:08:12.470 --> 00:08:17.300
What's super healthy?!
He's just eating grass off the road!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:27.940
Mr. Bear!

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.190
You got 30,000 Likes!

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:31.610
They're saying, "Cute!"

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:32.950
Take that!

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.510
A primitive man could never...

00:08:37.890 --> 00:08:39.580
<i>Mr. Bear!</i>

00:08:40.220 --> 00:08:42.080
35,000 Likes.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.580
He beat you again.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:46.040
They're saying, "Cute!"

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:49.090
What's cute?! What is this guy?!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:51.220
Maybe he's a <i>yokai</i>.

00:08:51.220 --> 00:08:52.210
Huh?

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.220
A <i>yokai</i>? Then what should I do?

00:08:55.220 --> 00:08:57.600
Maybe ask GeGeGe no Kitaro?

00:08:57.600 --> 00:09:00.390
GeGeGe no... what?

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:03.890
So...

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.440
what does the letter say?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:13.110
"A <i>yokai</i> called Jomon Man
is causing a disturbance."

00:09:13.110 --> 00:09:14.900
Jomon Man?

00:09:15.340 --> 00:09:17.910
You mean this?

00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.390
Dad...

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:25.540
This isn't a <i>yokai</i>.
He's a real Jomon era man.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:30.420
I thought he was living quietly on
Mt. Hibiridake in the Aoishi Mountains.

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.530
Why is he in the city?

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.360
How come?!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:40.850
Thank you for sending the letter,

00:09:40.850 --> 00:09:46.640
but Jomon Man isn't causing any harm,
so we can't help you.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:51.440
You won't defeat him?! But a <i>yokai</i> is
on the loose in human society!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.320
He's not even a <i>yokai</i>.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:56.120
But a primitive man on social media?!

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:59.070
Why are you so obsessed?

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.540
Why don't you just ignore him?

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:07.630
Sh-Shut up! That's none of your business!

00:10:07.630 --> 00:10:11.420
I went to the trouble of sending a letter!
You're useless!

00:10:11.420 --> 00:10:13.550
What's her problem?

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.990
I really don't like her.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:22.020
I'm tenth in number of followers...

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:24.060
and he's third?!

00:10:24.060 --> 00:10:25.690
That's impossible!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.710
Well in that case...!

00:10:29.500 --> 00:10:31.810
A gift from a fan!

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.150
50,000 Likes!

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.050
Amazing!

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:38.820
<i>A gift from a fan!</i>

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.410
70,000 Likes!

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:42.320
More amazing!

00:10:42.680 --> 00:10:45.330
Jomon Man beat you again.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:47.710
But I used all of my savings!

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:49.580
Isn't that a bit much?

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.800
Dammit! In that case...!

00:10:51.800 --> 00:10:53.420
Just give up already.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:54.960
Shut up!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.550
Talk about desperate.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.720
Too funny.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:00.720
NO STANDING ON THE BOXES

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:01.720
<i>Radiant!</i>

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:02.720
<i>Radiant!!</i>

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.470
<i>Radiant!!!</i>

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:04.370
#STANDING ON THE BOX

00:11:04.470 --> 00:11:05.890
<i>Like!</i>

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:05.790
72,000 LIKES

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:07.640
NO PLAYING WITH WATER

00:11:07.640 --> 00:11:09.390
<i>Radiant! Radiant!</i>

00:11:09.390 --> 00:11:11.650
<i>Radiant!</i>

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.150
<i>Like!</i>

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:13.040
75,000 LIKES

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:14.900
Like!

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:18.360
Take that, primitive man! I win!

00:11:18.360 --> 00:11:20.820
Like!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:24.950
<i>The rise in people breaking social
etiquette to upload to social media,</i>

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.140
<i>has become a major societal issue.</i>

00:11:25.430 --> 00:11:28.060
TODAY'S TOPIC: EXTREME SOCIAL MEDIA

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:31.460
<i>Apparently this was started by a post from
a popular amateur model</i>

00:11:28.180 --> 00:11:33.310
AMUSEMENT PARK BOXES REMOVED
SPRAYED WATER CAUSES ACCIDENT

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.420
<i>and is gaining criticism.</i>

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:35.760
Is that amateur model...?

00:11:35.760 --> 00:11:37.920
Apparently it's Chris.

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.760
Good grief.

00:11:39.760 --> 00:11:44.260
Why do humans go through this hassle?

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:48.020
I'd rather be flamed than ignored!

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.140
Oh, Mana.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.360
What is it?

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:53.770
<i>Cat-san.</i>

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:58.280
I just saw Jomon Man-san in town.

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:02.800
He was with Rat Man-san, so I was worried.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:08.140
I see. Thanks. Good job telling us.

00:12:11.730 --> 00:12:15.380
Thanks to Jomon Man's popularity,
I'm rolling in ad revenue!

00:12:15.380 --> 00:12:21.240
That stupid Chris girl self-destructed,
so who do I copy next?

00:12:21.610 --> 00:12:23.660
Hey, Rat Man.

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:27.760
Yo, Kita-chan! Still poor as ever?

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:30.690
Making a dirty profit again I see.

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:33.270
Send Jomon Man back to his mountain.

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.960
No way.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:38.240
We're not causing trouble for anyone.

00:12:38.240 --> 00:12:41.900
I mean, the humans are enjoying it,
aren't they?

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.120
<i>Like!</i>

00:12:41.920 --> 00:12:44.050
70,000 LIKES

00:12:43.120 --> 00:12:44.150
See?

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:48.140
But how does he feel about it?

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:51.680
Let's go back to your home.

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:54.270
<i>Hilipo lipoli.</i>

00:12:55.120 --> 00:12:57.710
See? He says he doesn't want to.

00:12:57.710 --> 00:12:59.420
Are you sure?

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.670
<i>Pilili palili.</i>

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:04.220
And there you have it, folks.

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:05.470
Later!

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:06.990
Later!

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:10.680
Dad...

00:13:10.680 --> 00:13:13.460
Let's wait this one out for now.

00:13:14.370 --> 00:13:19.690
Chris hasn't been posting on INSTE
since she screwed up.

00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:25.530
You ever notice how she only makes herself
look pretty in her pics?

00:13:25.530 --> 00:13:27.850
Talk about petty.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:33.080
And she calls herself "Christine",
but her real name's Kumiko.

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.020
Plus she's all Japanese.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.480
Wow that's sad.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:39.760
#GIGA DELUXE CAKE

00:13:38.860 --> 00:13:44.240
<i>"Want to go eat?"</i>

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:42.050
Ugh, a RAIN message from Chris.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.650
She's so irritating.

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.490
<i>"Want to go to a cafe?"</i>

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:46.590
Dammit! How dare they!

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:49.090
They ignored my messages!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.720
<i>Stop breaking social etiquette!</i>

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:52.940
<i>Do you really want Likes so much?</i>

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:54.810
<i>Your car and boobs are all fake.</i>

00:13:54.810 --> 00:13:58.020
<i>All those fakes and you still lose
to Jomon Man. Haha.</i>

00:13:58.020 --> 00:14:00.030
<i>I lost all my friends!</i>

00:14:00.030 --> 00:14:02.030
<i>And my money!</i>

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.610
<i>And...</i>

00:14:03.610 --> 00:14:05.720
<i>my precious Likes!</i>

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:07.570
#51 CHRISTINE MINATO

00:14:07.570 --> 00:14:08.610
#1 JOMON MAN

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:12.140
<i>It's all his fault!</i>

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:15.620
I won't be satisfied...

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:17.480
until I make him pay!

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.630
RAT MAN

